language ESSENCE' 1.0
$ Requires exactly m values in x to take one of the values in v. All other values may be anything from 0 to 7. Print the array x.
given n : int(1..)
given m : int(0..)
given v_dim1 : int(1..)
given v : matrix indexed by [int(1..v_dim1)] of int
find x : matrix indexed by [int(1..n)] of int(0..7)

branching on [x]

such that
$ exactly m entries of x take a value listed in v (v is the instance field, the set of allowed values)
(sum i : int(1..n) . (x[i] in toSet(v))) = m
